{"base":{"webm":"/voice/new-jacket-day-base-ccc28be3af9e.webm","m4a":"/voice/new-jacket-day-base-ccc28be3af9e.m4a","lines":{"bori|Hey! Over here!":[0,1791],"bori|Hold on—spin around for me!":[1941,1918],"bori|Whoa, I love your jacket!":[4009,2440],"me|Oh no, it's super cheap!":[6599,1703],"bori|Oh… I still think it's nice.":[8452,2432],"me|No, it's nothing special!":[11034,2107],"bori|Well, I think it looks great!":[13291,2767],"me|Aw, thanks! I got it on sale!":[16208,2483],"bori|No way! Tell me where!":[18841,2168],"me|Aw, thanks! I love it too!":[21159,2399],"bori|It totally suits you!":[23708,1713]}},"followUp":{"webm":"/voice/new-jacket-day-followUp-89762cde5f20.webm","m4a":"/voice/new-jacket-day-followUp-89762cde5f20.m4a","lines":{"bori|Wait, you didn't even pause once!":[0,2086],"me|Really? I was kinda winging it.":[2236,1690],"bori|Wow, your English is so natural!":[4076,2176],"me|No, no, my English is terrible!":[6402,2281],"bori|Hey, I really meant it though…":[8833,2300],"me|Oh, not at all! I'm still bad!":[11282,2752],"bori|Don't say that, you're good!":[14185,1649],"me|Thanks! Still a long way to go!":[15984,2226],"bori|Keep it up, you're crushing it!":[18360,1787],"me|Thanks! That really means a lot!":[20298,2136],"bori|Anytime! You've improved so much!":[22584,2822]}}}